{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nebula Veil is an atmospheric survival horror set in space, blending puzzles with simulator elements. Alone and confined to a tiny spaceship at the galaxy\u2019s edge, you must seek escape through debris fields, physical anomalies, alien fauna, and the decaying chambers of your own mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913370/extras/10f4dd3bcf4f1d74b642611ee44ee6d1.poster.avif?t=1766410436\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913370/extras/10f4dd3bcf4f1d74b642611ee44ee6d1.webm?t=1766410436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913370/extras/10f4dd3bcf4f1d74b642611ee44ee6d1.mp4?t=1766410436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were lucky. Unlike your colleagues, when the mothership collapsed, you happened to be in a fragile engineering vessel outside its hull. Now switches, sliders, screens, levers, and joysticks are your only means of interacting with the world around you - one wrong press could cost you your life</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913370/extras/c12f1a34762ec4a2a653dfc3fce8e1dc.poster.avif?t=1766410436\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913370/extras/c12f1a34762ec4a2a653dfc3fce8e1dc.webm?t=1766410436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913370/extras/c12f1a34762ec4a2a653dfc3fce8e1dc.mp4?t=1766410436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ER-426 isn\u2019t just a machine. It\u2019s a living system, and you\u2019re woven into it. Keep it alive: Monitor its condition, replace damaged components, extinguish fires and don't forget... to feed it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913370/extras/a8fb285c35336a6a92d1f8fafc6710a1.poster.avif?t=1766410436\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913370/extras/a8fb285c35336a6a92d1f8fafc6710a1.webm?t=1766410436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913370/extras/a8fb285c35336a6a92d1f8fafc6710a1.mp4?t=1766410436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world beyond the glass calls to be explored. Though your ship isn\u2019t agile, it carries tools well-suited for discovery. Initially limited to cameras and a basic manipulator, an attentive pilot can quickly expand ER-426\u2019s toolkit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913370/extras/0c145cfaaaf3d7e1764f604684cd82ba.poster.avif?t=1766410436\" width=780 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913370/extras/0c145cfaaaf3d7e1764f604684cd82ba.webm?t=1766410436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913370/extras/0c145cfaaaf3d7e1764f604684cd82ba.mp4?t=1766410436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Searching for anything in outer space is no simple task. Yet a simple SDR radio offers a surprisingly wide range of uses - from listening to music to tracking survivors and gathering information.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913370/extras/de57efa8c7774ba26706a884d53e813f.poster.avif?t=1766410436\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913370/extras/de57efa8c7774ba26706a884d53e813f.webm?t=1766410436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913370/extras/de57efa8c7774ba26706a884d53e813f.mp4?t=1766410436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Understanding the intercepted broadcasts, however, is another matter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913370/extras/da0d75e4c3d16ffdb94c3ce2c375765b.poster.avif?t=1766410436\" width=780 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913370/extras/da0d75e4c3d16ffdb94c3ce2c375765b.webm?t=1766410436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913370/extras/da0d75e4c3d16ffdb94c3ce2c375765b.mp4?t=1766410436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is more to the world around you than twisted wreckage. The vacuum has been replaced by a blood-red haze concealing creatures and objects beyond human comprehension. The denser the fog, the stranger its inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913370/extras/134816182e9dd0877402bd590d892c6a.poster.avif?t=1766410436\" width=780 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913370/extras/134816182e9dd0877402bd590d892c6a.webm?t=1766410436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913370/extras/134816182e9dd0877402bd590d892c6a.mp4?t=1766410436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the more medication you\u2019ll need to keep your psyche afloat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913370/extras/9444c50b4a19871d411d44b2d809092f.poster.avif?t=1766410436\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913370/extras/9444c50b4a19871d411d44b2d809092f.webm?t=1766410436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913370/extras/9444c50b4a19871d411d44b2d809092f.mp4?t=1766410436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s not only you who needs saving. Humanity\u2019s age of greatness has long passed. The world rusts and rots, and people scavenge like ants, living off the remnants of their ancestors\u2019 achievements. You may be just an insignificant detail of the machine - but even the smallest detail can alter the universe.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3913370?t=1766410436","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913370/8f2e9b8a2e01260d8a88ce67003a8b0e034dc13e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766410436","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913370/677ff16d064da2412d62227f15adae7ddcae5525/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766410436","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913370/677ff16d064da2412d62227f15adae7ddcae5525/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=176641