it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913370/extras/0c145cfaaaf3d7e1764f604684cd82ba.poster.avif?t=1766410436\" width=780 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913370/extras/0c145cfaaaf3d7e1764f604684cd82ba.webm?t=1766410436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913370/extras/0c145cfaaaf3d7e1764f604684cd82ba.mp4?t=1766410436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Searching for anything in outer space is no simple task. Yet a simple SDR radio offers a surprisingly wide range of uses - from listening to music to tracking survivors and gathering information.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913370/extras/de57efa8c7774ba26706a884d53e813f.poster.avif?t=1766410436\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913370/extras/de57efa8c7774ba26706a884d53e813f.webm?t=1766410436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913370/extras/de57efa8c7774ba26706a884d53e813f.mp4?t=1766410436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Understanding the intercepted broadcasts, however, is another matter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913370/extras/da0d75e4c3d16ffdb94c3ce2c375765b.poster.avif?t=1766410436\" width=780 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913